[2026-03-16T03:58:38.887Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EXSeAogz8QKs7dquJLCEz4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have successfully gathered all the relevant files for the Property Detail page. Let me create a comprehensive summary for you.\n\n## Property Detail Page - Complete File Structure\n\nI've found and read all files related to the Property Detail page in the Airbnb Clone application. Here's a comprehensive overview:\n\n### Main Page Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx`\n\nThe PropertyDetail page is the main container component that:\n- Fetches property data via Redux using the `fetchPropertyDetail` thunk from the `propertyDetailSlice`\n- Uses `useParams` to get the property ID from the URL\n- Displays loading and error states\n- Renders the full property detail layout with all sub-components\n\n### Routing Configuration\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n\nRoutes the Property Detail page at: `/properties/:id`\n\n### Redux State Management\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertyDetailSlice.ts`\n\nManages the Property Detail page state including:\n- Property data fetching from `/api/properties/{propertyId}`\n- Loading and error states\n- `clearPropertyDetail` action for cleanup\n\n### Sub-Components Used by PropertyDetail\n\n1. **ImageGallery** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ImageGallery.tsx`)\n   - Displays a grid layout with main image and thumbnails\n   - Allows clicking thumbnails to change main image\n   - Shows image captions\n   - \"Show all photos\" button for galleries with more than 5 images\n\n2. **PropertyHeader** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyHeader.tsx`)\n   - Displays star rating and review count\n   - Shows host information with avatar, name, and years hosting\n   - Includes scroll-to-reviews link\n\n3. **PropertyInfo** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyInfo.tsx`)\n   - Shows property type, guest capacity, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms\n   - Displays check-in and check-out times with formatted times\n\n4. **PropertyDescription** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyDescription.tsx`)\n   - Displays property description\n   - Implements expand/collapse for descriptions longer than 300 characters\n\n5. **AmenitiesList** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/AmenitiesList.tsx`)\n   - Groups amenities by category with icons\n   - Prioritizes certain amenities (WiFi, kitchen, pool, etc.)\n   - Shows initial 10 amenities with \"Show all\" option\n   - Uses lucide-react icons for visual representation\n\n6. **BookingCard** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingCard.tsx`)\n   - Sticky sidebar card for booking properties\n   - Includes date picker with calendar for check-in/checkout\n   - Guest count dropdown\n   - Price breakdown (nightly + cleaning fee)\n   - Booking validation and reservation functionality\n   - Shows booked date ranges and prevents past date selection\n\n7. **ReviewsSection** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ReviewsSection.tsx`)\n   - Displays overall rating and review count\n   - Shows category ratings (cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value)\n   - Lists individual reviews with guest info and ratings\n   - Shows initial 6 reviews with \"Show all\" option\n\n8. **HostInfoCard** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/HostInfoCard.tsx`)\n   - Displays host profile information\n   - Shows host avatar, name, and host status\n   - Displays review count, rating, years hosting\n   - Shows member since date and number of listings\n   - Includes host bio if available\n\n### Page Layout Structure\n\nThe PropertyDetail page uses a responsive two-column layout:\n- **Left column (flex-1):** Property details stacked vertically (header, info, description, amenities, reviews, host card)\n- **Right column (sticky sidebar, w-full lg:w-[372px]):** BookingCard that sticks to viewport while scrolling\n\nAll components are fully responsive with mobile-first design (max-sm: utilities for small screens)."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a5b640730f79e2973 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 38989\ntool_uses: 17\nduration_ms: 18652</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2eb78e56-88a3-4b5b-b71a-173ede6214fd","uuid":"1996d345-d221-4c70-ab82-d697a2cca717","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find all files related to the Property Detail page in /repo/apps/AirbnbClone. I need to see the page component and any sub-components it uses. Search for files with \"PropertyDetail\" or \"property-detail\" or \"propertyDetail\" in the name, and also check the routing setup to understand how this page is structured. Read all relevant component files fully and return their contents. Be thorough - check src/pages/, src/components/, and any other relevant directories.","agentId":"a5b640730f79e2973","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have successfully gathered all the relevant files for the Property Detail page. Let me create a comprehensive summary for you.\n\n## Property Detail Page - Complete File Structure\n\nI've found and read all files related to the Property Detail page in the Airbnb Clone application. Here's a comprehensive overview:\n\n### Main Page Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx`\n\nThe PropertyDetail page is the main container component that:\n- Fetches property data via Redux using the `fetchPropertyDetail` thunk from the `propertyDetailSlice`\n- Uses `useParams` to get the property ID from the URL\n- Displays loading and error states\n- Renders the full property detail layout with all sub-components\n\n### Routing Configuration\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n\nRoutes the Property Detail page at: `/properties/:id`\n\n### Redux State Management\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertyDetailSlice.ts`\n\nManages th